&lt;th width=&quot;530&quot; style=&quot;width: 530px&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The veterinary nurse will comply with &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RCVS Day One Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; for veterinary nurses and be able to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
