&lt;p&gt;Self-Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;530&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage own performance and development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take measures to improve performance and competence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engage in continued professional and personal development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Use professional standards of practice to self-assess performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
