&lt;td width=&quot;226&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work within legal and ethical limits&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;531&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conform to approved procedures&lt;/p&gt;
